<title>PHILIPPINES: Meralco 9-mth sales up 10.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Meralco 9-mth sales up 10.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales of Manila Electric Co for the first nine months rose by 10.8 percent to 13.2 billion kilowatt-hours compared to the year-ago level, the company said in a statement on Monday.</p>
</text>
